        "created_at": "2014-08-15T04:35:43.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Can someone explain to me how Citizen Dawn works?&nbsp; I'm a little confused.&nbsp; All I see for bringing out Citizens is Return with the Dawn, which only gets out a maximum of one of them and (unless I missed something) only lets her switch Citizens every 2 turns.&nbsp; This doesn't feel very thematic for her and seems strange given her synergy with other Citizens and Truth &amp; Dare's anti-synergy with each other.</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:42:10.651Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
