        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>Can someone explain to me how Citizen Dawn works?&nbsp; I&#39;m a little confused.&nbsp; All I see for bringing out Citizens is Return with the Dawn, which only gets out a maximum of one of them and (unless I missed something) only lets her switch Citizens every 2 turns.&nbsp; This doesn&#39;t feel very thematic for her and seems strange given her synergy with other Citizens and Truth &amp; Dare&#39;s anti-synergy with each other.</p>",
